0357, "title": "Silk stockings", "work_id": 87800, "role": "cast", "role_id": 33, "is_primary": false}, {"id": 2296720, "title": "Shall we dance?", "work_id": 81178, "role": "cast", "role_id": 33, "is_primary": false}, {"id": 2289859, "title": "Top Hat", "work_id": 81299, "role": "cast", "role_id": 33, "is_primary": false}, {"id": 2289276, "title": "Ziegfeld Follies", "work_id": 81916, "role": "cast", "role_id": 33, "is_primary": false}, {"id": 2284092, "title": "The Towering inferno", "work_id": 88651, "role": "cast", "role_id": 33, "is_primary": false}, {"id": 2270755, "title": "You were never lovelier", "work_id": 86244, "role": "cast", "role_id": 33, "is_primary": false}, {"id": 2265373, "title": "Second chorus", "work_id": 81181, "role": "cast", "role_id": 33, "is_primary": false}, {"id": 2257264, "title": "Royal Wedding", "work_id": 79684, "role": "cast", "role_id": 33, "is_primary": false}, {"id": 2245510, "title": "Follow the fleet", "work_id": 95436, "role": "cast", "role_id": 33, "is_primary": false}, {"id": 2245366, "title": "Flying down to Rio", "work_id": 95447, "role": "cast", "role_id": 33, "is_primary": false}, {"id": 2240894, "title": "Finian's rainbow", "work_id": 83369, "role": "cast", "role_id": 33, "is_primary": false}, {"id": 2213456, "title": "Easter parade", "work_id": 81196, "role": "cast", "role_id": 33, "is_primary": false}, {"id": 2163511, "title": "Daddy long legs (Captioned)", "work_id": 84223, "role": "cast", "role_id": 33, "is_primary": false}, {"id": 2163460, "title": "Daddy long legs", "work_id": 85438, "role": "cast", "role_id": 33, "is_primary": false}, {"id": 2151571, "title": "On the beach", "work_id": 84979, "role": "cast", "role_id": 33, "is_primary": false}, {"id": 2130151, "title": "Carefree", "work_id": 95427, "role": "cast", "role_id": 33, "is_primary": false}, {"id": 1992946, "title": "Three little words", "work_id": 88485, "role": "cast", "role_id": 33, "is_primary": false}, {"id": 1988279, "title": "Funny face", "work_id": 84568, "role": "cast", "role_id": 33, "is_primary": false}], "also_known_as": "Frederick Austerlitz", "date_of_birth": "1899-05-10", "date_of_death": "1987-06-22", "places_of_operation": [{"id": 1, "name": "United States of America", "slug": "united-states-of-america"}], "biography": "Fred Astaire (born Frederick Austerlitz May 10, 1899 – June 22, 1987) was an American dancer, actor, singer, choreographer and presenter. He is widely regarded as the \"greatest popular-music dancer of all time\". He received numerous accolades including an Honorary Academy Award, three Primetime Emmy Awards, a BAFTA Award, two Golden Globe Awards, and a Grammy Award. He was honored with the Film Society of Lincoln Center tribute in 1973, the Kennedy Center Honors in 1978, and AFI Life Achievement Award in 1980. He was inducted into the Hollywood Walk of Fame in 1960, American Theatre Hall of Fame in 1972, and the Television Hall of Fame in 1989.\nAstaire's career in stage, film, and television spanned 76 years. He starred in more than 10 Broadway and West End musicals, made 31 musical films, four television specials, and numerous recordings. As a dancer, he was known for his uncanny sense of rhythm, creativity, and tireless perfectionism. Astaire's most memorable dancing partnership was with Ginger Rogers, whom he co-starred with in 10 Hollywood musicals during the classic age of Hollywood cinema, including Top Hat (1935), Swing Time (1936), and Shall We Dance (1937). Astaire's fame grew in films like Holiday Inn (1942), Easter Parade (1948), The Band Wagon (1953), Funny Face (1957), and Silk Stockings (1957). The American Film Institute named Astaire the fifth-greatest male star of Classic Hollywood cinema in 100 Years... 100 Stars.", "biography_author": "Wikidata", "date_of_biography": "2023-08-01T14:52:41.413465+10:00", "external_links": [{"id": 3997, "uri": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fred_Astaire"}], "uuid": "030e42da-439c-41fc-a57a-33174b6ec395", "source": {"name": "Verno